{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d3105ec0-fe8e-8150-b66c-b1bfaf4ee054",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T13:40:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, Wilson Andrade here. I'm calling about the streetlights. The whole block lost its lights last night, every one of them, wicked dark out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the whole block went out overnight. Was that during the storm, the snow and then the rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the one. It started up Sunday and it's wrapping up now. Lights were on early in the evening, then around ten or so, nothing. Still out when I went by this morning, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is there a particular pole you think is the problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:40:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a pole on the corner with a wire hanging a little low and the transformer thing on it. I figure that's the one. I'd like a crew to come check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it. What street are you on, or the nearest cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not on the block right now, I'm out walking. Shuttle's delayed so I'm going a long way on foot, so I'd rather not give you the whole thing from memory and get it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs the exact spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:40:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0158."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0158, Wilson Andrade, streetlights out for the whole block since last night, request a crew check the pole. I'll send that over to the dispatcher."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:40:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all I need. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:40:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Wilson. Stay safe out there."
    }
  ],
